# Local environment and cache files are excluded, and so are the diagnostic and
# archive folders listed at the end, which commands rerun into results/ but which
# are not results. Code, data, both result sets and the reports are tracked.
venv/
__pycache__/
.cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store

# Blinding keys (added 2026-10-02, publication-fixes B1): a key links coded
# image names to the originals and must never be committed. The blind
# subcommand refuses to write one inside the repository; these patterns are a
# second guard.
code_key*
*_key.csv
# Claude Code settings for this machine, not part of the pipeline. The agent
# definitions are tracked: the image reviewer of the review loop
# (results/archive/REVIEW_LOOP.md) is one.
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/

# The AI judge experiment (branch exp-ai-layer, docs/EXPERIMENT_AI.md). The API
# key is read from the environment and is never written to a file; a .env is
# ignored here as a second guard, as the blinding keys are above.
.env
.env.*

# Written again whenever its command reruns, so ignored rather than tracked: the
# per-image brightness variants, the low cut overview layer and the coded contact
# sheet of the figures script (results/<group>/5_archive/), and the diagnostic
# folders, which the diagnostics write to .cache/ by default. The files as they
# were on 2026-10-20 are at commit bf3b982.
results/*/5_archive/not_used/
results/*/5_archive/variants_per_image_brightness/
